{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>WeAreSecurity</strong> is a minimalist, atmospheric horror game where you're a worker monitoring camera feeds on an aging desktop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">At first you are assigned with two cameras to watch. If you have good performance then two more cameras to watch will be added until  a max of eight cameras.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The things you are observing in the cameras are not human. If you observe any actions that seem otherworldly then make sure to report them so they can be corrected. Don't waste company resources with false reports.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">If you perform well enough with the max amount of cameras then you will be considered the<strong> best</strong>\u00a0employee and earn a promotion!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">If you make too many mistakes you will not  advance to the next set of cameras.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Malfunctioning cameras can be fixed by turning them off and back on. As the days past the cameras tend to get less reliable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You are an employee for <strong>WeAreSecurity</strong>. <strong><i>Strive to be the best employee!</i></strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4073740?t=1762579060","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4073740?t=1762579060","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073740/4ce92c31c93f2553d1f6c42544542bb0b3776f87/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762579060","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073740/4ce92c31c93f2553d1f6c42544542bb0b3776f87/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762579060","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Some depictions of mild violence."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>WeAreSecurity</strong> is a minimalist, atmospheric horror game where you're a worker monitoring camera feeds on an aging desktop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">At first you are assigned with two cameras to watch. If you have good performance then two more cameras to watch will be added until  a max of eight cameras.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The things you are observing in the cameras are not human. If you observe any actions that seem otherworldly then make sure to report them so they can be corrected. Don't waste company resources with false reports.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">If you perform well enough with the max amount of cameras then you will be considered the<strong> best</strong>\u00a0employee and earn a promotion!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">If you make too many mistakes you will not  advance to the next set of cameras.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Malfunctioning cameras can be fixed by turning them off and back on. As the days past the cameras tend to get less reliable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You are an employee for <strong>WeAreSecurity</strong>. <strong><i>Strive to be the best employee!</i></strong></p>","developers":["FutilityForge"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073740/283fd02c23cb593f621a3701475f667b248445e2/header.jpg?t=1762579060","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"WeAreSecurity","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Core i5 6600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 760<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["FutilityForge"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Medo","rating":"10","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"10","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"\u00c4ngstigende Inhalte","rating":"6","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"6","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"To be announced"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073740/a248da486addc463194e514b4345bb2326716665/ss_a248da486addc463194e514b4345bb2326716665.1920x1080.jpg?t=1762579060","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073740/a248da486addc463194e514b4345bb2326716665/ss_a248da486addc463194e514b4345bb2326716665.600x338.jpg?t=1762579060"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073740/2034044269032d6834081b0796787e6bb831e8e2/ss_2034044269032d6834081b0796787e6bb831e8e2.1920x1080.jpg?t=1762579060","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/st